                <pb facs="0544" n="420" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg420"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.77/220: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-03-09T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 9, 1923—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received March 10—10:35
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>30. President Borno has this morning informed me that he approves of plan of
                    reorganization [of] National Railroad. …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
